  <running_head>CANTICORVM.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Chara tu vnic è mihi,</l>
    <l n="2">Tu mea ô columbula,</l>
    <l n="3">Tu mea integ rrima.3.</l>
    <l n="4">Ast ego,eheu,restitās-</l>
    <l n="5">Nuda quinā,inquā iacens,</l>
    <l n="6">Vestem ego refumpferim:</l>
    <l n="7">Et pedes quos ablui,</l>
    <l n="8">Inquinarim denuo!</l>
    <l n="9">4. Interim manum sera-</l>
    <l n="10">Amouentem sentiens-</l>
    <l n="11">Vnicè charum mihi:</l>
    <l n="12">Corde toto palpitans,</l>
    <l n="13">Surgo,prendo myrrhæis-</l>
    <l n="14">Totum odoribus manu-</l>
    <l n="15">Delibutam pessulum.</l>
    <l n="16">5. Pando ianuæ fores-</l>
    <l n="17">Vnicè charo mihi,</l>
    <l n="18">Illesed discesserat,</l>
    <l n="19">Iile iam transiuerat,</l>
    <l n="20">Vnicè charus mihi:</l>
    <l n="21">Cuius ante vocula-</l>
    <l n="22">Intimis vitam mihi-</l>
    <l n="23">Ex medullis sux: rat.</l>
    <l n="24">Ergo vt amens cursito,</l>
    <l n="25">Quæritánsque clamito:</l>
    <l n="26">Ille pâret nuspiam,</l>
    <l n="27">Nec vocantem exaudiit.</l>
    <l n="28">6. Ciuitatis obuia-</l>
    <l n="29">Fasta sic custodibus,</l>
    <l n="30">Cædor imò vulneror,</l>
    <l n="31">Quin peplū ipsūmet mihi</l>
    <l n="32" para="true">Forte si videbitis,</l>
    <l n="33">Id reperto dicite,</l>
    <l n="34">Ipsius languere me-</l>
    <l n="35">Casto amore sauciam.</l>
    <l n="36">
      <i>Hierofolymitan-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="37">
      <i>æ.</i>8 At cedo,hē tu virgin-</l>
    <l n="38">ūOmnium pulcherrima,</l>
    <l n="39">Iste char s vnicè.</l>
    <l n="40">Charus vnicè tibi,</l>
    <l n="41">Præstat ecquè d vnicus</l>
    <l n="42">Cætetis amiculis!</l>
    <l n="43" type="heading" level="3" para="true">SPONSA.</l>
    <l n="44">9. Ille tàm charus mihi</l>
    <l n="45">Candicat totus rubens,</l>
    <l n="46">Candicans totus rubet:</l>
    <l n="47">Dena qualis militum</l>
    <l n="48">Eminens vexillifer</l>
    <l n="49">Splendet inter millia.</l>
    <l n="50">10. Fulget eius aureum,</l>
    <l n="51">Aureum micans caput,</l>
    <l n="52">Cuius obrizum tegit</l>
    <l n="53">Crispulæ nodos comæ,</l>
    <l n="54">Qua nigra nullus coma</l>
    <l n="55">Coruus vsquam nigrior,</l>
    <l n="56">11. Est columbæ prædítus</l>
    <l n="57">Pætulis ocellulis,</l>
    <l n="58">Laéteo pupillu is</l>
    <l n="59">Irrigatis alueo:</l>
    <l n="60">Pala qualis annuli</l>
    <l n="61">Gemmeum claudit decus,</l>
    <l n="62">12. Huic genæ sunt areæ</l>
    <l n="63">Plantulis aromatum</l>
    <l n="64">Vndiquaque confitæ:</l>
    <l n="65">Nempe confurgentibus</l>
    <l n="66">Crispule lanuginis</l>
    <l n="67">Hinc &amp; inde flocculis,</l>
    <l n="68">Abstulere, mœnia</l>
    <l n="69">Noæ qui custodiunt.</l>
    <l n="70">7. Ah, Sionis filiæ,</l>
    <l n="71">Vos ego obtestor, meum</l>
    <l n="72">Vnicè charum mihi</l>
  </main_text>
